diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 20fdc15..d6ddc98 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,17 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Implement valid-pointer critical-section spin-count initialization for the
+  existing one-processor guest profile; inspect raw DLL-entry ABI before restoration.
+
+- Add opt-in strict execution failure for missing imports, unknown/interpreted
+  calls and untranslated DLL entries during synthetic CRT experiments.
+
+- Preserve 128-bit SIMD memory operand widths during PE recovery.
+
+- End translated paths at PE-identified Kernel32 ExitProcess/ExitThread IAT
+  calls, preserving independent entries and failing if an exit import returns.
+
 - Allow native game adapters to place their own cursors at absolute touch
   positions in logical game pixels. Placement can discard pending DirectInput
   X/Y movement without losing button, wheel or keyboard input.
